    "text_with_image_7kcWgU": {
      "type": "text-with-image",
      "settings": {
        "padding_top": 36,
        "padding_bottom": 36,
        "maufactured_image_text": "shopify://shop_images/Rectangle_324.png",
        "manufactured_inline_text": "<h2>beauty products that are good for your skin</h2><p>Loving who you are is about taking care of yourself, and that’s why our products include good-for-you elements, like nourishing hydration and moisturizing that you won’t find in any other concealer. We also source only the highest-quality ingredients, because your skin deserves nothing less.<br/></p><h2>manufactured for the highest quality</h2><p>Love Who You Are beauty products are designed to bring out your natural beauty, no matter your age. That’s why we’re so particular about what we put into our products—and it’s why you get the best look, every time, without creasing, flaking, or fading. </p><h2>lab tested for safety<br/></h2><p>Your safety is our priority. That’s why each of our Love Who You Are beauty products is tested by a third-party lab and we NEVER test on animals.</p>",
        "txtbg": "#f6f6f6",
        "txtColor": "#1c1d52"
      }
    },
